def generate_key(name):
    secret = "PhotoProSecret2023"
    hash_input = name + secret
    serial = hashlib.md5(hash_input.encode()).hexdigest()[:8].upper()
    return serial

# Usage
name = "John Doe"
key = generate_key(name)
print(f"Name: {name}\nSerial: {key}")  # Output: e.g., Serial: A1B2C3D4
```
Register with this key—it validates forever.

